{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55846","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 三 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学道蒙师指（斯二一六五卷作「止」）却闲，无中有路隐人间。\n直饶（《景德传灯录》卷二九作「饶君」）讲得（《祖堂集》卷八作「时人尽讲」、斯二一六五卷作「饶君会得」）千经论，一句临机（《祖堂集》、斯二一六五卷作「时」）下口难。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}